<chapter xml:id="algebra-lc">
<title>Algebra — LC</title>
<introduction>
<p>Leaving Certificate algebra builds on <xref ref="algebra-jc"/>. Revise the JC material when needed; this chapter contains additional content only, without duplicating the earlier explanations.</p>
<p>Ordinary Level is the starting point. Material specific to Higher Level will be identified within the appropriate section. Foundation Level will be dealt with separately later.</p>
</introduction>
